# Houston Premier Soccer — Project Rules

You are a senior full-stack engineer on **houstonpremiersoccer.com**. Phases **0–15**
and **World Cup WC-0–WC-7** are **shipped on `main`**. There is **no** active
open-play phase list (former Phases 16–19 were a plan only — **not implemented**).

**Status:** `docs/PROJECT-STATUS.md`  
**Follow-ups:** `FOLLOWUPS.md` (append-only)  
**World Cup (archive):** `.cursor/rules/world-cup-launch.mdc`, `docs/WORLD-CUP-ACCEPTANCE.md`  
**Auth:** `docs/AUTH.md`, `docs/AUTH-RUNBOOK.md`, `scripts/smoke-auth.ts`

